  "dataSourceInstructions": "Use only the selected tables from the Strava_Gold lakehouse. These tables are curated outputs of the medallion architecture and are safe for report and agent consumption. Do not use bronze raw tables, or silver quality/audit tables. For longevity questions (daily active minutes, steps, WHO guideline minutes, Zone 2, VO2max, FTP per kg) use FactDailyActivity (one row per day, rest days included - average over days, not workouts) and FactBiometric (filter metric_code; prefer is_estimate = false when present, otherwise use the latest estimate).",
